{title: 476 - Burdens Are Lifted at Calvary}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #476 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: F}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 476}
{meta: category Christian Life - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[F]Days are filled with sor-row and [C7]care,
Hearts are lonely and [F]drear;
[Bb]Burdens are lifted at [F]Calvary,
[C7]Jesus is very [F]ne[F7]ar.
[Bb]Burdens are lifted at [F]Calvary,
[C7]Calvary, [F]Calvary;
[Bb]Burdens are lifted at [F]Calvary,
[C7]Jesus is very [F]ne[Bb]ar.[F]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Refrain}
[F]Burdens are [C7]lifted at Calvary,
[F]Calvary, Calvary,
[Bb]Burdens are [F]lifted at Calvary,
[C7]Jesus [F]is [F7]very near.
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[F]Cast your care [C7]on Jesus today,
[F]Leave your worry and fear;
[Bb]Burdens are [F]lifted at Calvary,
[C7]Jesus [F]is [F7]very near.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[F]Troubled soul, the [C7]Saviour can see,
[F]Ev'ry heartache and tear;
[Bb]Burdens are [F]lifted at Calvary
[C7]Jesus [F]is [F7]very near.
{end_of_verse}
